        "date": "2026-11-08T10:55:46Z"
      },
      "message": "build(wasm): camcraft-app links for wasm32 via a pinned wasi-sysroot\n\nRung 1 of the app/UI-on-wasm story. web/build-app-wasm.sh builds\ncamcraft-app (flecs' C included) for wasm32-unknown-unknown and links\ncamcraft-cli.wasm: the pinned wasi-sysroot 34 supplies libc headers and\nlibc.a for flecs.c, and three checked edits to copies of flecs_ecs 0.2.2 /\nflecs_ecs_sys 0.2.1 (libc::FILE, \"C-unwind\" bindings, a wasm-gated\nimport) are wired in with cargo --config patch for that build only.\nNative builds and the tracked Cargo.lock are untouched. The manual\n(workflow_dispatch) wasm CI job runs the script.\n\nThe UI rung is not here: egui-winit 0.36.2 does not compile for wasm32,\nso the browser shell needs eframe's web runner; the remaining blockers\nare listed in docs/decisions/31-wasm-ui.md.\n\nRefs #31\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
